{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51491","headline":"骊山怀古（五首） 三 · 李郢","name":"骊山怀古（五首） 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫府灵坛降玉真，华清台殿影长新。\n雪翻晓艳御阶秀，风送夜香宫树春。\n杉桂静同无梦客，烟花深似有愁人。\n自从霜落芙蓉死，空使秦山鬼哭频。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李郢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51491.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51491","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}